      "source_locale": "en",
      "source_text": "If Mock-up is required to be submitted to HA, ACM starts a BLUE Project as per “WPD-991 LMG Start of a BLUE Project“ when requested by the concerned Affiliate. This Mock-Up contains artwork that is for submission purposes.",
